    "text": "By KERA ,\n12 hours ago Dallas City Manager Kimberly Tolbert will start looking into real estate and economic development options for City Hall — and potentially a new location — after a city council vote Wednesday. The resolution passed in a 12-3 vote. Council members Paula Blackmon, Cara Mendelsohn and Paul Ridley voted... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
